1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,810
Empezamos en el sur de Europa,

2
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:02,570
en Italia:

3
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:04,410
el sugo alla genovese,

4
00:00:04,520 --> 00:00:05,750
salado y espeso,

5
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:08,330
una salsa de carne y cebolla cocida lento

6
00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:10,230
que se sirve con pasta ziti.

7
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:11,770
Viajamos al sur de Asia,

8
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:12,510
a la India:

9
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:13,870
el dal tadka,

10
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:15,290
salado y especiado,

11
00:00:15,340 --> 00:00:17,150
un guiso de lentejas que se come con

12
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:18,510
arroz o con roti.

13
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:20,050
Seguimos al este de Asia,

14
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:20,810
a Japón:

15
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:22,070
el kare udon,

16
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:23,730
salado y reconfortante,

17
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:26,410
fideos gruesos en caldo de curry con cebollín

18
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:26,950
por encima.

19
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:29,270
Cruzamos el Pacífico hasta México:

20
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:30,810
la carlota de limón,

21
00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:32,090
dulce y cítrica,

22
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:34,450
un postre frío que se termina con ralladura

23
00:00:34,460 --> 00:00:35,130
de limón.

24
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:36,450
Bajamos hasta Perú:

25
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:37,870
el ceviche mixto,

26
00:00:37,980 --> 00:00:39,070
salado y ácido,

27
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:41,090
pescado y mariscos marinados en limón,

28
00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:42,930
con camote y choclo al lado.

29
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:44,470
Y terminamos en Argentina:

30
00:00:44,660 --> 00:00:47,090
la chocotorta, dulce y cremosa,

31
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:49,090
que se come bien fría y con más

32
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:50,270
dulce de leche arriba.

